{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"28437234-f1be-440d-9452-c51de1bd38ab","hash":"614d6f651b91bfac3d7be7a44af2ff98d650796d222f284ec165c0a4d33a1233","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""},{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The 3D canvas is rotating and offset because it's sized from a tilted container's bounding box, which is larger than the container itself. I'll make the canvas measure the container's real size and then place the neuron deliberately.\n\n","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01YMni9tYeQXVcEDjvy9xboH","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /c/Users/jerem/BioHacks-2026/frontend && sed -i \"s/translate(calc(-50% + 10%), calc(-50% - 2%))/translate(calc(-50% + 9%), calc(-50% - 4%))/; s/^const MODEL_SIZE = 10.5 .*/const MODEL_SIZE = 12 \\/\\/ largest dimension, world units/; s/          dpr={\\[1, 2\\]}\\n//\" src/components/neuron-viewer.tsx && python - <<'EOF'\np='src/components/neuron-viewer.tsx'\ns=open(p,encoding='utf8').read()\na=\"\"\"          camera={{ position: [0, 0, 12], fov: 65 }}\"\"\"\nb=\"\"\"          camera={{ position: [0, 0, 12], fov: 65 }}\n          // Measure layout size, not the rotated bounding box, so the scene stays centred in the tilted frame.\n          resize={{ offsetSize: true }}\"\"\"\nassert a in s; s=s.replace(a,b)\nopen(p,'w',encoding='utf8').write(s)\nEOF\nnpx tsc -b && echo TSC_OK && cd \"C:/Users/jerem/AppData/Local/Temp/claude/2ea77955cf64b3d5/28437234-f1be-440d-9452-c51de1bd38ab/scratchpad\" && node cdp-shot.mjs http://127.0.0.1:5180/ cl6 1440 900 \"4000|0:document.querySelector('.dither-container').style.display='none'|5000\" 2>&1 | grep -E \"wrote|EXC\"","description":"Fix canvas sizing in tilted frame, re-screenshot","timeout":120000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
