{"parentUuid":"5d69d578-5b91-4ff7-a714-68c65300fb2d","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgpQEFwEuzw7UixaTAJAx","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Got it. Here's what I'll change.\n\n**Neuron**\n- Stand it upright: rotate it 90° so its long axis is vertical.\n- Spin it about that vertical axis, the way Callio's DNA spins about its own length. Dragging only spins it around that axis.\n- Drop the 30° tilt.\n\n**Loading screen:** remove it. The model is 288 KB and loads almost instantly, so it'll just fade in when ready.\n\n**Own identity instead of a Callio clone**\n- **Colour:** warm paper-white with deep ink-navy dither instead of pure black-and-white, and a teal-ink tinted neuron.\n- **Type:** Motus' original Sora for the wordmark, with an Instrument Serif italic subtitle in place of Chillax and Synonym.\n- **Sign-in button:** a solid ink pill instead of Callio's glass one.\n- **Dashboard:** the same palette carries through."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":158,"cache_read_input_tokens":570075,"output_tokens":2904,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":2371},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":158,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":4,"output_tokens":2904,"cache_read_input_tokens":570075,"cache_creation_input_tokens":158,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":158},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"184530e0-8d62-4571-afe6-e3f2eba23870","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgpQEFRVMsnXqH96kaBz4","requestRef":"c2261af2-4a1d-4947-a324-064285fc8f54","requestedModel":"claude-opus