{"parentUuid":"e5d01ffe-7a63-4a08-a648-5d5bb9e09b2e","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgpjbzLwkdEWk8mahz5Dq","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I've renamed everything to **Addo Labs** with the description \"ALS drug discovery optimization\", and the tab icon and link-preview image now show the neuron. The build passes.\n\n**Rename**\n- **Browser tab:** the title is \"Addo Labs\", and the page description reads \"Addo Labs — ALS drug discovery optimization.\"\n- **Landing page:** the wordmark is \"addo labs\" (lowercase, same style as before) with the subtitle \"ALS drug discovery optimization\".\n- **Dashboard:** the sidebar wordmark is now \"addo labs\".\n- **Internals:** the package name and code comments are renamed too, so nothing says Motus any more.\n\n**Icons, from the actual neuron.** I rendered the neuron itself, at rest on the paper background, rather than drawing an icon:\n- **Tab icon (32 px) and home-screen icons (180, 192 and 512 px):** a crop of the cell body and dendrites. It still reads as a neuron at 32 px.\n- **Link preview (`og-image.png`, 1200×630):** what shows when the link is shared in Slack, iMessage, Discord and so on. It's the landing page with wordmark, subtitle, neuron and sign-in button. I hid the \"Add Supabase keys\" note that the demo mode shows.\n- **Installed app:** `site.webmanifest` gives the name, description and colours.\n\nThe old drawn icon (`favicon.svg`) is deleted.\n\n**Two things to know:**\n- **Dashboard content is unchanged.** The heading and description are now about drug discovery, but the dashboard still shows the patient monitoring from before: typing, speech and handwriting signals, and the ALSFRS-R forecast. If Addo Labs is a drug-discovery tool, that dashboard needs rethinking. Tell me what it should show and I'll rebuild it.\n- **Regenerating the icons:** the script is outside the project, at `C:\\Users\\jerem\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\claude\\2ea77955cf64b3d5\\28437234-f1be-440d-9452-c51de1bd38ab\\scratchpad\\make-icons.mjs`. Copy it into the repo if you want to rerun it after changing the neuron's look."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1722,"cache_read_input_tokens":562283,"output_tokens":738,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1722,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":738,"cache_read_input_tokens":562283,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1722,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1722},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"a8a5047d-ee4c-44d0-9e6b-99739944385a","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Cgpjbz3ayJSMcVoELmyoL","requestRef":"f8e32901-7200-4ca8-b80f-0ec87eb3ad84","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","promptCacheRequested":"1h","type":"assistant","uuid":"dfa27c09-cc66-4242-97d7-da7227547498","timestamp":"2026-11-08T03:16:38.705Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","session_id":"28437234-f1be-440d-9452-c51de1bd38ab","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\jerem\\BioHacks-2026\\frontend","sessionId":"28437234-f1be-440d-9452-c51de1bd38ab","version":"2.1.319","gitBranch":"frontend/diagnosis"}
