{"parentUuid":"bf040869-a1fa-4459-a912-3d2b0e2dcbb8","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"edited_text_file","filename":"C:\\Users\\jerem\\BioHacks-2026\\frontend\\src\\components\\discovery\\workspace.tsx","snippet":"","rereadEntry":{"timestamp":1794108499637,"contentHash":"7lvqozhplpkq","contentLength":22281}},"type":"attachment","uuid":"0be67fc5-bcbc-4216-b32b-4bd0f01889ef","timestamp":"2026-11-08T03:28:20.217Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\nNote: C:\\Users\\jerem\\BioHacks-2026\\frontend\\src\\components\\discovery\\workspace.tsx changed on disk since you last read it. That's usually deliberate, so take it as the current state rather than reverting it; if the change looks wrong, say so rather than undoing it yourself — otherwise no need to call it out. The changes are not shown here; use Read if you need the current content.\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","session_id":"28437234-f1be-440d-9452-c51de1bd38ab","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\jerem\\BioHacks-2026\\frontend","sessionId":"28437234-f1be-440d-9452-c51de1bd38ab","version":"2.1.319","gitBranch":"frontend/diagnosis"}
{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"28437234-f1be-440d-9452-c51de1bd38ab","hash":"4d02c731b0f70402d1a5f8fe65d68f9ba5a8ab973ef98bb69182e6b0cced8c2a","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"Making the five lane bars on the rail fill in as each agent finishes, then building the Runs page (the counterpart to Callio's Projects panel):"},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_016Do7ZjoSqfH6AiKwRMeuQy","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /c/Users/jerem/BioHacks-2026/frontend && python - <<'EOF'\np='src/components/discovery/workspace.tsx'\ns=open(p,encoding='utf8').read()\ndef r(a,b):\n    global s\n    assert a in s, a[:60]; s=s.replace(a,b)\nr(\"function PipelineRail({ stages }: { stages: State['stages'] }) {\",\"function PipelineRail({ stages, profilesDone }: { stages: State['stages']; profilesDone: number }) {\")\nr(\"style={{ background: c, opacity: st === 'pending' ? 0.2 : st === 'done' || l < 5 ? 1 : 0.3 }}\",\"style={{ background: c, opacity: l < profilesDone ? 1 : st === 'running' ? 0.35 : 0.2 }}\")\nr(\"<PipelineRail stages={state.stages} />\",\"<PipelineRail stages={state.stages} profilesDone={state.profiles.length} />\")\nopen(p,'w',encoding='utf8').write(s)\nEOF\necho ok","description":"Light lane bars per completed profile"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_014FQpCxWpiTFBzbB1fN1DW2","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"C:\\Users\\jerem\\BioHacks-2026\\frontend\\src\\components\\discovery\\runs.tsx","content":"import { useState } from 'react'\nimport { ArrowLeft, FileText } from 'lucide-react'\nimport { Button } from '@/components/ui/button'\nimport { SAMPLE_PATIENT, rank, CANDIDATES } from '@/lib/pipeline'\nimport { Report } from './report'\nimport type { CompletedRun } from './workspace'\n\n/** Saved runs as paper previews (Callio Labs' Projects panel, for reports). */\nexport default function Runs({ runs, onNewRun }: { runs: CompletedRun[]; onNewRun: () => void }) {\n  const [open, setOpen] = useState<CompletedRun | null>(null)\n\n  if (open) {\n    return (\n      <div className=\"mx-auto max-w-4xl\">\n        <Button size=\"sm\" variant=\"ghost\" className=\"mb-3\" onClick={() => setOpen(null)}>\n          <ArrowLeft aria-hidden /> All runs\n        </Button>\n        <div className=\"rounded-xl bg-card p-6 ring-1 ring-border backdrop-blur-md\">\n          <Report patient={SAMPLE_PATIENT} weights={open.weights} date={open.date} />\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    )\n  }\n\n  return (\n    <div className=\"mx-auto max-w-[1440px]\">\n      <div className=\"mb-4 rounded-xl bg-card px-5 pt-5 pb-4 ring-1 ring-border backdrop-blur-md\">\n        <p className=\"eyebrow\">Discovery / Runs & reports</p>\n        <h2 className=\"font-brand mt-3 text-[clamp(2.25rem,3.6vw,3.25rem)] leading-none\">Every run, with its evidence.</h2>\n      </div>\n      {runs.length === 0 ? (\n        <div className=\"rounded-xl bg-card p-8 ring-1 ring-border backdrop-blur-md\">\n          <p className=\"text-muted-foreground\">No runs yet in this session.</p>\n          <Button className=\"mt-4\" onClick={onNewRun}>Start a discovery run</Button>\n        </div>\n      ) : (\n        <div className=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 sm:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-4 xl:grid-cols-5\">\n          {runs.map((r) => {\n            const top = rank(CANDIDATES, r.weights)[0]\n            return (\n              <button\n                key={r.id}\n                type=\"button\"\n                onClick={() => setOpen(r)}\n                className=\"group overflow-hidden rounded-xl bg-card text-left ring-1 ring-border backdrop-blur-md transition-transform duration-200 ease-out hover:-translate-y-0.5 active:scale-[0.98]\"\n              >\n                <div className=\"relative mx-3 mt-3 h-36 overflow-hidden rounded-t-md bg-white shadow-[0_-4px_12px_rgb(0_0_0/0.06)]\">\n                  <div className=\"absolute top-0 right-0 size-5\" style={{ background: 'linear-gradient(225deg, #e7e2d8 50%, #f6f3ed 50%)' }} />\n                  <p className=\"px-3 pt-3 text-[11px] leading-snug font-semibold text-foreground/80\">\n                    Alternative therapeutic candidates for {SAMPLE_PATIENT.label}\n                  </p>\n                  <div className=\"mt-2 flex flex-col gap-1.5 px-3\">\n                    {[90, 70, 82, 55, 75].map((w, i) => (\n                      <div key={i} className=\"h-1 rounded-full bg-foreground/[0.07]\" style={{ width: `${w}%` }} />\n                    ))}\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n                <div className=\"border-t px-3 py-2.5\">\n                  <p className=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm font-medium\">\n                    <FileText className=\"size-3.5 text-muted-foreground\" aria-hidden /> Top: {top.drug}\n                  </p>\n                  <p className=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground\">{r.date}</p>\n                </div>\n              </button>\n            )\n          })}\n        </div>\n      )}\n    </div>\n  )\n}\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
