ecks interactions against the current list.',\r","+  },\r","+  visits: {\r","+    title: 'Every visit, in one place.',\r","+    description: 'Clinician-rated ALSFRS-R, FVC, and notes from each appointment.',\r","+    placeholder: 'Clinic visit records are coming soon.',\r","+  },\r","+  diary: {\r","+    title: 'What the numbers miss.',\r","+    description: 'Cramps, fatigue, swallowing, falls — logged in a few taps.',\r","+    placeholder: 'The symptom diary is coming soon.',\r","+  },\r","+  fus: {\r","+    title: 'Opening the barrier, on purpose.',\r","+    description: 'MR-guided focused ultrasound briefly opens the blood–brain barrier over motor cortex so large drugs can reach it.',\r","+    placeholder: 'Delivery planning (target region, session schedule, site availability) is coming soon.',\r","+  },\r","+  trials: {\r","+    title: 'Studies the patient may qualify for.',\r","+    description: 'Open ALS and focused-ultrasound trials matched to the patient and the run’s candidates.',\r","+    placeholder: 'Trial matching is coming soon.',\r","+  },\r","+  'care-team': {\r","+    title: 'Who sees the results.',\r","+    description: 'Share reports with the neurologist, clinic nurse, or carer.',\r","+    placeholder: 'Care-team access is coming soon.',\r","+  },\r","+  sources: {\r","+    title: 'Where the evidence comes from.',\r","+    description: 'NCBI, ClinVar, Open Targets, DRKG and open web search, with their versions.',\r","+    placeholder: 'Data-source settings are coming soon.',\r","+  },\r","+  privacy: {\r","+    title: 'The patient’s data, the patient’s call.',\r","+    description: 'What is stored, who can see it, and how to export or delete it.',\r","+    placeholder: 'Privacy controls are coming soon.',\r","+  },\r","+  settings: {\r","+    title: 'Make it fit your lab.',\r","+    description: 'Models, agent count, ranking defaults and report format.',\r","+    placeholder: 'Settings are coming soon.',\r","+  },\r","+}\r","+\r","+export default function Home() {\r","+  const { user, loading, configured, signOut } = useAuth()\r","+  const [view, setView] = useState('discovery')\r","+  const [runs, setRuns] = useState<CompletedRun[]>([])\r","+  const [runKey, setRunKey] = useState(0)\r","+\r","+  if (configured && loading) return null\r","+  if (configured && !user) return <Navigate to=\"/\" replace />\r","+\r","+  // Without Supabase keys the page still renders, on sample data, so the UI can be worked on.\r","+  const meta = user?.user_metadata ?? {}\r","+  const profile: Profile = user\r","+    ? { name: meta.full_name ?? meta.name ?? user.email ?? 'You', email: user.email ?? '', avatar: meta.avatar_url ?? meta.picture }\r","+    : { name: 'Demo patient', email: 'Sign-in not configured' }\r","+  const firstName = profile.name.split(/\\s+/)[0]\r","+\r","+  // \"New discovery run\" resets the workspace.\r","+  const select = (v: string) => {\r","+    if (v === 'new-run') {\r","+      setRunKey((k) => k + 1)\r","+      setView('discovery')\r","+    } else setView(v)\r","+  }\r","+  const label = ALL_NAV.find((n) => n.value === view)?.label ?? 'Discovery'\r","+  const section =\r","+    NAV_GROUPS.find((g) => g.items.some((i) => i.value === view))?.label ??\r","+    (NAV_SECONDARY.some((i) => i.value === view) ? 'Account' : 'Discovery')\r","+  const page = VIEWS[view]\r","+\r","+  return (\r","+    <div className=\"relative h-dvh w-full overflow-hidden text-foreground\">\r","+      {/* The landing's dither field runs behind the whole workspace. */}\r","+      <div className=\"fixed inset-0 z-0\" aria-hidden>\r","+        <Dither\r","+          waveSpeed={0.02}\r","+          waveFrequency={3}\r","+          waveAmplitude={0.3}\r","+          backgroundColor={DITHER_PAPER}\r","+          waveColor={DITHER_INK}\r","+          colorNum={4}\r","+          pixelSize={2}\r","+          disableAnimation={reducedMotion}\r","+          enableMouseInteraction\r","+          mouseRadius={1.2}\r","+        />\r","+      </div>\r","+\r","+      <TooltipProvider delayDuration={0}>\r","+        <SidebarProvider\r","+          className=\"relative z-10 h-dvh min-h-0 !bg-transparent\"\r","+          style={{ '--sidebar-width': 'calc(var(--spacing) * 72)', '--header-height': 'calc(var(--spacing) * 12)' } as React.CSSProperties}\r","+        >\r","+          <AppSidebar active={view} onSelect={select} profile={profile} onSignOut={user ? signOut : undefined} />\r","+          <SidebarInset className=\"min-h-0 overflow-y-auto !bg-transparent\">\r","+            <header className=\"sticky top-0 z-10 flex h-(--header-height) shrink-0 items-center gap-2 border-b border-border bg-background/60 backdrop-blur-md\">\r","+              <div className=\"flex w-full items-center gap-1 px-4 lg:gap-2 lg:px-6\">\r","+                <SidebarTrigger className=\"-ml-1\" />\r","+                <Separator orientation=\"vertical\" className=\"mx-2 data-[orientation=vertical]:h-4\" />\r","+                <h1 className=\"text-base font-medium\">{label}</h1>\r","+              </div>\r","+            </header>\r","+            <div className=\"px-4 pt-6 pb-16 lg:px-6\">\r","+              {view === 'overview' ? (\r","+                <OverviewDashboard firstName={firstName} />\r","+              ) : (\r","+                <div className=\"pt-8 lg:pt-12\">\r","+                  <p className=\"eyebrow mb-8\">{section} / {label}</p>\r","+                  <div aria-live=\"polite\">\r","+                    <h2 className=\"font-brand text-[clamp(2.75rem,7vw,4.5rem)] leading-none\">{page.title}</h2>\r","+                    <p className=\"mt-6 max-w-xl text-lg text-muted-foreground\">{page.description}</p>\r","+                  </div>\r","+                  <Card className=\"mt-12 max-w-2xl gap-4 [--card-spacing:--spacing(8)]\">\r","+                    <div className=\"px-8\">\r","+                      <p className=\"eyebrow\">Coming soon</p>\r","+                      <h3 className=\"mt-4 text-2xl font-medium\">{label}</h3>\r","+                      <p className=\"mt-4 text-muted-foreground\">{page.placeholder}</p>\r","+                    </div>\r","+                  </Card>\r","+                </div>\r","+              )}\r","+            </div>\r","+          </SidebarInset>\r","+        </SidebarProvider>\r","+      </TooltipProvider>\r","+    </div>\r","+  )\r","+}"]}]}],"moreFiles":0,"changedFiles":["C:\\Users\\jerem\\BioHacks-2026\\frontend\\src\\pages\\Home.tsx"]}},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"02b89803-1927-42e9-8108-5fb763bbcf43","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/c/Users/jerem/BioHacks-2026/frontend","root":"/c/Users/jerem/BioHacks-2026","branch":"frontend/diagnosis","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":10,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":13},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"penguinyogurt/BioHacks-2026","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"penguinyogurt/BioHacks-2026","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"penguinyogurt/BioHacks-2026","visibility":"public"}]}},"live_cwd":"/c/Users/jerem/BioHacks-2026/frontend","platform":"windows"}},"sandboxed":false,"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"44eaad8c-fe12-4ec6-a124-795bc3fe786f","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"session_id":"28437234-f1be-440d-9452-c51de1bd38ab","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\jerem\\BioHacks-2026\\frontend","sessionId":"28437234-f1be-440d-9452-c51de1bd38ab","version":"2.1.319","gitBranch":"frontend/diagnosis"}
