{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"28437234-f1be-440d-9452-c51de1bd38ab","hash":"78b234f7d4c60d486b802cdc23eadff97a4425c337bf42f4500e513298f910e7","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""},{"type":"thinking","thinking":"React's dev mode mounts components twice, and this component destroys its WebGL context on cleanup, so the second mount draws nothing; I'm patching our copy so cleanup no longer destroys the context.\n\n","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_0176GjV7pStCue2Lgkwx6JGb","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /c/Users/jerem/BioHacks-2026/frontend && python - <<'PYEOF'\np='src/components/react-bits/GradientASCII.tsx'\ns=open(p,encoding='utf8').read()\na=\"      gl.getExtension('WEBGL_lose_context')?.loseContext();\\n\"\nassert a in s\ns=s.replace(a,\"      // Addo Labs patch: don't force-lose the context. React StrictMode remounts with the same\\n      // <canvas>, and getContext() would hand back the dead context. The browser frees it on unmount.\\n\")\nopen(p,'w',encoding='utf8').write(s)\nPYEOF\ncat > src/components/background.tsx <<'EOF'\nimport GradientASCII from '@/components/react-bits/GradientASCII'\n\nconst reducedMotion = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches\n\n/**\n * React Bits Gradient ASCII, in the Addo palette: a teal-to-ink gradient drawn\n * as monospace glyphs on paper. Shared by the landing page and the workspace.\n */\nexport function AsciiBackground({ quiet = false }: { quiet?: boolean }) {\n  return (\n    <div className=\"absolute inset-0 bg-background\" aria-hidden>\n      <GradientASCII\n        lightMode\n        shape=\"horizon\"\n        colors={['#d7ecef', '#7fb8c1', '#2f6f7c', '#13293d']}\n        characters=\" .:-=+*#%@\"\n        fontFamily='\"Geist Mono Variable\", ui-monospace, monospace'\n        cellSize={14}\n        density={0.85}\n        glyphOpacity={quiet ? 0.55 : 0.8}\n        gradientOpacity={quiet ? 0.35 : 0.6}\n        glow={0.15}\n        flicker={0.15}\n        flow={0.5}\n        speed={reducedMotion ? 0 : 0.6}\n        grain={0.05}\n        clickEffect=\"wave\"\n      />\n    </div>\n  )\n}\nEOF\nsleep 1; cd \"C:/Users/jerem/AppData/Local/Temp/claude/2ea77955cf64b3d5/28437234-f1be-440d-9452-c51de1bd38ab/scratchpad\" && node cdp-shot-gpu.mjs http://127.0.0.1:5180/ fix 1440 900 \"6000\" 2>&1 | grep -E \"wrote|EXC\"; node cdp-shot-gpu.mjs http://127.0.0.1:5180/home/case fixh 1440 900 \"6000\" 2>&1 | grep -E \"wrote|EXC\"","description":"Patch context loss, restore palette, screenshot","timeout":120000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
