{"parentUuid":"17842cdb-91dd-4147-b740-ba78581aaeb1","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"deferred_tools_record","entries":[],"toolInputCopies":[{"id":"toolu_01MLSwuGPBVnbc8PxSzocmVh","copy":"wire"}]},"type":"attachment","uuid":"e856c7e3-5e24-4a13-b1b0-52b34b83e319","timestamp":"2026-11-08T04:23:38.251Z","session_id":"28437234-f1be-440d-9452-c51de1bd38ab","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\jerem\\BioHacks-2026\\frontend","sessionId":"28437234-f1be-440d-9452-c51de1bd38ab","version":"2.1.319","gitBranch":"frontend/diagnosis"}
{"parentUuid":"e856c7e3-5e24-4a13-b1b0-52b34b83e319","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgppiLxCHMJjdLugeUqkH","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All three changes are in, and the build passes.\n\n**1. Progress strip removed.** The row of five stage boxes under each page heading is gone; step status now shows only in the sidebar.\n\n**2. The pipeline advances manually.** \"Run patient analysis\" on the Patient case page runs only that stage, then the run pauses. To start the next stage, either:\n- click the dark button at the bottom of the page (\"Run profile agents\", \"Run DRKG embedding\", \"Run research & ranking\", \"Write the report\"), or\n- open the next step's page, which shows \"Ready\" with a run button.\n\nThe app no longer changes page by itself. \"Skip to results\" is now \"Finish this step\", which completes only the current stage. Clear run appears whenever the run is paused or finished. In the test, every stage paused and waited, including still waiting three seconds after it finished, and each started only on a click.\n\n**3. Gradient ASCII background** from React Bits, on both the landing page and the dashboard:\n- **Colours:** Addo palette, light teal through to ink navy, drawn as monospace characters (` .:-=+*#%@`) on the paper background, fading to plain paper behind the text.\n- **Dashboard:** a quieter version, so the cards stay readable.\n- **Interaction:** the characters scramble around your cursor and ripple when you click.\n- **Replaced:** the old dither background and its packages are removed.\n\n**One fix inside the React Bits component.** At first the background drew nothing. React's dev mode mounts each component twice, and this component destroys its WebGL context on cleanup. The second mount then gets that dead context back from the same canvas, so it shows only Chrome's broken-canvas icon in the corner. A production build would have worked, but `npm run dev` didn't. I removed that one cleanup line in `src/components/react-bits/GradientASCII.tsx`, marked with an \"Addo Labs patch\" comment. If you re-download the component from React Bits later, the bug comes back. I checked the result with the machine's real GPU: the headless browser's software GPU can't render this component even with the fix, so the screenshots are from the real GPU.\n\nBackground colours and density are in `src/components/background.tsx`. Nothing is committed yet."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":566,"cache_read_input_tokens":815012,"output_tokens":721,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":566,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":721,"cache_read_input_tokens":815012,"cache_creation_input_tokens":566,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":566},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"27feb60e-ba7d-40cc-b899-6ab10400cd75","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgppiLcqncsvFvvT9c6La","requestRef":"d4912b0e-efa9-4cd3-b986-db2e51508f64","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","promptCacheRequested":"1h","type":"assistant","uuid":"791e7315-533c-4778-bcc1-04abe746ac45","timestamp":"2026-11-08T04:23:38.250Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","session_id":"28437234-f1be-440d-9452-c51de1bd38ab","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\jerem\\BioHacks-2026\\frontend","sessionId":"28437234-f1be-440d-9452-c51de1bd38ab","version":"2.1.319","gitBranch":"frontend/diagnosis"}
