{"parentUuid":"ed33fc65-fff5-4438-a9bd-e07b18a6ccf8","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"deferred_tools_record","entries":[],"toolInputCopies":[{"id":"toolu_011QoNW5sC3T94Rd56jHCYLX","copy":"wire"}]},"type":"attachment","uuid":"8fc8eed3-cc7f-4f5b-9bb1-fe6950670d93","timestamp":"2026-11-08T05:00:35.225Z","session_id":"28437234-f1be-440d-9452-c51de1bd38ab","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\jerem\\BioHacks-2026","sessionId":"28437234-f1be-440d-9452-c51de1bd38ab","version":"2.1.319","gitBranch":"frontend/diagnosis"}
{"parentUuid":"8fc8eed3-cc7f-4f5b-9bb1-fe6950670d93","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgpsXjXYQd14UFgyzx7Mo","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The landing page is reworked as you described, and the build passes. Nothing is committed.\n\n- **Neuron:** lies horizontally across the top, spanning about 90% of the width. The cell body and dendrites are on the right, and the axon runs left to terminals that sit just above the name. It slowly rolls about its own long axis, which keeps the terminals in place for the glow, and you can drag up or down anywhere to spin it.\n- **Name:** \"addo labs\", the subtitle and the sign-in button sit in the bottom-left.\n- **Glow, from cell to name:**\n  1. Each firing starts at the cell body.\n  2. The amber pulse travels the full width of the screen along the axon to the terminals, which light up.\n  3. As it reaches them, an amber glow leaves the terminals and curves down to the wordmark, along a faint dotted guide.\n  4. When it arrives, \"addo labs\" flushes amber with a soft glow, then settles back to ink.\n\nI checked frame sequences on the real GPU, and every step appears in order. Reduced-motion visitors get a still neuron with no firing or glow.\n\n**Code:**\n- **Neuron:** `src/components/neuron-viewer.tsx`, which reports the terminals' screen position each time a pulse arrives.\n- **Glow and wordmark:** `useSignalToName` in `src/pages/Landing.tsx`.\n- **Placement and size:** `AXIS_Y`, `FILL_W` and `ROLL_SPEED` at the top of the viewer file.\n\n**Repo housekeeping:**\n- **Merged earlier work:** your branch already contains everything from earlier (merged via PR #3), so this round's changes are the only uncommitted ones.\n- **No claim needed:** you already hold the frontend track on the board.\n- **Board updated, not pushed:** `AGENTS.md` asks agents to update `docs/STATUS.md` before stopping, so I added a Done line. I haven't committed or pushed it, because this branch is two merge commits ahead of origin and pushing would send those too. Push it with your next commit.\n- **Out-of-date board row:** \"Pick the name: code says Addo Labs, landing says motus\" no longer applies, since both say Addo Labs now. `AGENTS.md` still describes the frontend as \"Motus\". I've left both for whoever owns the board, rather than editing other people's rows."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":309,"cache_read_input_tokens":860440,"output_tokens":785,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":309,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":785,"cache_read_input_tokens":860440,"cache_creation_input_tokens":309,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":309},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"7c92a878-ef07-4f71-9e2c-c655a8b9f1d9","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgpsXj7ERJW6vCyUwgtUL","requestRef":"25faee05-73a6-437f-a9d3-8ee41d7cd2f8","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","promptCacheRequested":"1h","type":"assistant","uuid":"c9f94fc5-9a2c-4c01-ab24-2ef350416492","timestamp":"2026-11-08T05:00:35.225Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","session_id":"28437234-f1be-440d-9452-c51de1bd38ab","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\jerem\\BioHacks-2026","sessionId":"28437234-f1be-440d-9452-c51de1bd38ab","version":"2.1.319","gitBranch":"frontend/diagnosis"}
